. * Authors: [REDACTED] & Carsten Schröder
. 
. /* Deviations from PAP:
> 
> We recognized that the method specified in our pre-analysis plan (PAP) was no
> t sufficiently robust for replication.
> Therefore, we chose to rely on two-way fixed effects (TWFE) models estimated 
> via standard OLS regressions using "reghdfe".
> 
> According to our PAP specification, there was no remaining variation in treat
> ment.
> To address this, we adjusted the number of pre- and post-treatment periods. 
> To avoid concerns of cherry-picking, we did not impose a fixed number of pre-
>  or post-treatment periods.
> 
> */
. 
. 
. * ============================
. * Setup
. * ============================
. 
. //clear all
